{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b5d49ed50cd903599bd8fa47a3425194854b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84958f805b063032d2629160e880abc1487afa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/0/c90fd1fc0619c3f2aef23043dde76ff8bc6a53a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - p =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b2972c863cd256294146841573206acea13e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ -2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 2-2p \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ 2p-2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ |2p-2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"505\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/0066b0925494b88bfdc27340e3799945650a0ef1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e0c9fe53284fc1fc418baf62e3a7253237ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is negative so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17ca9926829c83f5db6aaf9c3b8f1956975a99d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x - 2| = 2-x = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/a/11ab653a51e2a8fb950e64e1181cb4f22e63e5a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2-p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c875e2a52aba5edbe3a8b8df2b6e32586568acf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-p = (2-p)-p = \\boxed{\\mathbf{(C)}\\ \\ensuremath{2-2p}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"274\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985c50b44f48c90edb8ef9d72be12f97b983bed1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e254b22b3d661c41887725ace5c5580134a8f3f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2dfe66e807e49b4d88493822a90dde09e1934a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - p = -22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />.  Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e254b22b3d661c41887725ace5c5580134a8f3f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> into choices (A) through (E) yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f62a7ef4601cb29e2d8e22dca4e924d795d6d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> respectively, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f20522fe74a512b4dc714670ce1ba6d7dfc996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(C)}\\ \\ensuremath{2-2p}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"32\" /> is correct.\n</p><p>-Monkey_King, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p3bwMuK1RUM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p3bwMuK1RUM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/albUhCOwv3Y?si=4XcusOEp70EA6XKr\">https://youtu.be/albUhCOwv3Y?si=4XcusOEp70EA6XKr</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10\">2000 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-re